SB

class Dog with name and age
    method bark as
        say self's name plus " says woof!".
    end
    method birthday as
        say self's name plus " is now " plus self's age.
    end
end
set rex to new Dog with "Rex" and 3.
say rex's name.
say rex's age.
rex's bark.
set buddy to new Dog with "Buddy" and 7.
buddy's birthday.
